RTL8852BE Wi-Fi — licensing overview
Copyright (c) 2026 Issen Software Group

Licences apply per component; this repository is not wholly MIT licensed.

1. MIT (LICENSES/MIT.txt)
   Original app, CLI, IPC, IOUserClient, crypto, kext module stub, build and
   installer scripts, tests (except the upstream reference snapshot), and
   documentation retain their MIT terms.

2. GPL-2.0-only (LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt)
   Linux-derived hardware support and firmware-container parsing:
     src/RTL8852BE.cpp, src/RTL8852BE.hpp, src/RTL8852BE_hw.hpp,
     src/RTL8852BE_tables.cpp, src/RTL8852BE_tables.hpp,
     src/RTL8852BE_firmware_parser.cpp, src/RTL8852BE_efuse.cpp/.hpp,
     src/RTL8852BE_phy.cpp/.hpp, src/RTL8852BE_power.cpp/.hpp,
     src/RTL8852BE_linux_regs.hpp, src/RTL8852BE_register_io.hpp.
   Linux rtw89 source generally offers GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause. This project
   distributes its derived hardware code under the GPL-2.0 option, consistent
   with its existing third-party notices. The compiled kernel extension as a
   whole is GPL-2.0-only; corresponding source is this repository:
   https://github.com/AA-EION/RTL8852BE-macOS-WiFi
   The unmodified structure snapshot in tests/reference retains its upstream
   GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause notice.

3. Realtek firmware (LICENSES/LicenseRef-rtw89-firmware.txt)
   src/rtw8852b_fw.bin and the embedded bytes in src/RTL8852BE_firmware.cpp
   are redistributed unmodified under Realtek's firmware terms.

The app and kernel extension communicate through the IOKit user-client
interface as separate programs. See NOTICE.md for third-party attribution.
